                                    <p>
                                      The Foundation supports Century College through meaningful partnerships and philanthropic leadership. Thanks to the generosity of donors and community partners, the Foundation awards scholarships and emergency grants to students, supports programs including the Start Right Program for first-time students, and helps remove barriers like hunger and housing insecurity. These investments break down financial barriers, uplift students, and build a stronger, more resilient community. Join us!
