                                            <span class="lw_item_thumb"><picture class="lw_image"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/live/image/scale/2x/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.webp 2x, /live/image/scale/3x/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.webp 3x" data-origin="responsive"/><source type="image/png" srcset="/live/image/scale/2x/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.png 2x, /live/image/scale/3x/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.png 3x" data-origin="responsive"/><img src="/live/image/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.png" alt="Counselor, Michele is meeting with a student in her office." width="300" height="200" srcset="/live/image/scale/2x/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.png 2x, /live/image/scale/3x/gid/136/width/300/height/200/crop/1/src_region/0,0,3900,2600/4436_2024-MegaMenu-Counseling.rev.1727880783.png 3x" data-max-w="3900" data-max-h="2600" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/></picture></span>
                                          </div>
                                        </div>
                                      </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>
                                      Century College is committed to the success of each student. This commitment to student success and persistence is demonstrated by the numerous student services and support available in and out of the classroom, including academic resources, assistive services, student wellness options and planning support.
                                    </p>
