									<section class="section-postscript">
										<div class="section-postscript-content">
											<div class="panel-pane pane-fieldable-panels-pane pane-current-226 news-events-first pane-bundle-text">
												<h2 class="pane-title">Discover What's Next!</h2>
												<div class="fieldable-panels-pane">
													<div class="paragraphs-items paragraphs-items-field-add-text paragraphs-items-field-add-text-full paragraphs-items-full">
														<div class="field field--name-field-add-text field--type-paragraphs field--label-hidden">
															<div class="field__items">
																<div class="field__item even">
																	<div class="entity entity-paragraphs-item paragraphs-item-text paragraphs-item-2166">
																		<div class="content">
																			<div class="field field--name-field-oc-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden">
																				<div class="field__items">
																					<div id="main" class="field__item even editable">
																						<p>Century College is a two-year community and technical college located in White Bear Lake, Minnesota. As one of the largest and most diverse and affordable colleges in Minnesota, we serve over 19,000 credit and non-credit students each year.&#160;</p>
																						<p>Century College offers over 150 degrees, diplomas and certificates in a wide variety of high-demand program areas, including applied design, arts and humanities, business, health sciences, human services, science, technology, engineering and mathematics (STEM), social and behavioral sciences, trade and industry,&#160;and non-credit workforce training.</p>
																						<p>Dedicated to student success, Century College graduates more than 1,600 students each year, awarding over 1,900 degrees, diplomas and certificates.</p>
																						<p><a href="/admissions">Discover What&#x2019;s Next!&#160;&#x203A;</a></p>
																						<iframe id="lw-inline-style-c7b46fa2" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1093113499?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479" title="Century College, Discover What's Next! Video" class="lw_media lw_media_responsive vimeo" loading="lazy"></iframe>
																						<p><a id="apply-today"></a>&#160;</p>
																					</div>
																				</div>
																			</div>
																		</div>
																	</div>
																</div>
															</div>
														</div>
													</div>
												</div>
											</div>
