																<div id="tabs-fronpage_news_and_events-middle-3" aria-labelledby="ui-id-3" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" aria-expanded="false" aria-hidden="true">
																	<div class="panel-pane pane-views-panes pane-news-panel-pane-3"><div class="view view-news view-id-news view-display-id-panel_pane_3 view-dom-id-ccf0c7dc65c5479cc3a9160d738cce6a"><div class="view-content"><div class="item-list"><ul><li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even"><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content"><a href="/live/news/1103-century-college-recognized-as-a-2026-leader"><span class="date"><span class="e-day">3</span>Mar</span><div class="content"><div class="title">          Century College Recognized as a 2026 Leader College by Achieving the Dream        </div><div class="desc">          Century College has been designated a 2026 Leader College by Achieving the Dream (ATD), a national nonprofit organization committed to advancing community colleges as accessible hubs of learning, credentialing, and economic mobility. Leader Colleges are recognized for meaningful progress in expanding access; improving early momentum metrics such as retention; advancing evidence-based student success strategies; and strengthening institutional capacity through intentional culture and systems change.        </div></div></a></span></div></li><li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even"><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content"><a href="/live/news/1096-century-college-raises-the-curtain-on-renovated"><span class="date"><span class="e-day">10</span>Nov</span><div class="content"><div class="title">          Century College Raises the Curtain on Renovated Performing and Visual Arts Center        </div><div class="desc">          WHITE BEAR LAKE, Minn. &#x2014; Century College celebrated the grand opening of its newly renovated Performing and Visual Arts Center on Friday, November 7, 2025, with an evening filled with creativity, connection, and community.        </div></div></a></span></div></li><li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even"><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content"><a href="/live/news/1094-century-college-celebrates-expansion-of-dental"><span class="date"><span class="e-day">15</span>Oct</span><div class="content"><div class="title">          Century College Celebrates Expansion of Dental Hygiene Program with Ribbon Cutting Ceremony        </div><div class="desc"></div></div></a></span></div></li><li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even"><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content"><a href="/live/news/1092-meet-century-college-alum-janel-swanson"><span class="date"><span class="e-day">18</span>Sep</span><div class="content"><div class="title">          Meet Century College Alum Janel Swanson        </div><div class="desc">          Janel Swanson&#x2019;s path to kitchen and bath design began with a spark&#x2014;ignited during a home remodel that transformed more than just her living space. After years devoted to raising her children and teaching, she found herself captivated by the process of creating beautiful, functional environments.     What started with selling cabinets on Craigslist quickly grew into a thriving business, driven by her eye for detail, love of learning, and a bold leap into entrepreneurship.        </div></div></a></span></div></li><li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even"><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content"><a href="/live/news/1091-meet-century-college-student-broden-lombard"><span class="date"><span class="e-day">16</span>Sep</span><div class="content"><div class="title">          Meet Century College Student Broden Lombard        </div><div class="desc">          Broden Lombard has always been fueled by creativity. From building robots as a kid to performing in band, orchestra, and marching band, his passion for design and innovation has been a constant thread throughout his life.     &#x201C;If you didn&#x2019;t learn something today, you didn&#x2019;t try hard enough,&#x201D; Broden says.   &#x201C;There&#x2019;s so much to learn every day out there in the world.&#x201D;        </div></div></a></span></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="view-footer"><a href="/home/news/">View All</a></div></div></div>
																</div>
															</div>
														</div>
													</div>
												</div>
											</div>
